{"3572900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Galago", "steam_appid": 3572900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/ed393aeaa317dc54a1403789d74453ab.poster.avif?t=1775540732\" width=718 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/ed393aeaa317dc54a1403789d74453ab.webm?t=1775540732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/ed393aeaa317dc54a1403789d74453ab.mp4?t=1775540732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galago is a <strong>2D</strong> <strong>exploration-platformer</strong>, blending <strong>puzzle-solving</strong>, <strong>survival</strong>, and  <strong>mystery</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the 6 <strong>golden fireflies</strong> per level. Some are <strong>hidden</strong>, others are in plain-sight, yet seemingly out of reach...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you explore, your endeavour will be hindered by <strong>hunger</strong>, <strong>hazards </strong>and <strong>predators</strong>. To survive, you must <strong>forage</strong> for tree sap and insects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not the galago's natural habitat — you are  in the city's <strong>wealthiest</strong> <strong>suburb</strong>. As you skitter along walls, peering through warmly lit windows, what <strong>stories</strong> might you witness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s