ng>suburb</strong>. As you skitter along walls, peering through warmly lit windows, what <strong>stories</strong> might you witness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/742aace5b29728d3816aed1d9c5547ec.poster.avif?t=1775540732\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/742aace5b29728d3816aed1d9c5547ec.webm?t=1775540732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/extras/742aace5b29728d3816aed1d9c5547ec.mp4?t=1775540732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "As night falls, a galago — also known as a bush baby — ventures into suburbia, searching for elusive golden fireflies. But the world is perilous for one so small… Galago is an exploration-platformer, blending puzzle-solving, survival, and mystery. ", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/09f59983347be49dff28f48bb8b33f00b9ad7982/header.jpg?t=1775540732", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/1b2cdb20816476904b1849fdcdf5d2714926c1d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775540732", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572900/1b2cdb20816476904b1849fdcdf5d2714926c1d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775540732", "website": "https://galago.carrd.co/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD FX-4300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 / NVIDIA GT 710<br></li>